======================================================================
PART A -- symbolic (sympy) cross-check of the coefficient recursion
======================================================================

Phi-equation, coefficient of g^1 (should give a2 in terms of a1,b1):
  -c*s*b1(s) + c*a0(s) - c*a1(s) + c*b1(s) - 2*a2(s) + Derivative(a1(s), s) = 0
  -> a2(s) solved from this single equation: -c*s*b1(s)/2 + c*a0(s)/2 - c*a1(s)/2 + c*b1(s)/2 + Derivative(a1(s), s)/2
  -> hand-recursion formula for a2(s):            -c*((s - 1)*b1(s) - a0(s))/2 - c*a1(s)/2 + Derivative(a1(s), s)/2
  -> difference (should simplify to 0):            0

Psi-equation, coefficient of g^1 (should give the b1 ODE):
  -c*s*b1(s) + c*a0(s) + Derivative(b1(s), s) = 0

(These confirm the hand recursion below reproduces exactly what
 matching powers of g in the STATED PDE system gives -- no transcription
 error in the recursion used for parts B/C.)

Extending the symbolic check to k=2 (needed for a3(0)/b2(s) below):
  a3(s) [from g^2 coeff of Phi-eq]: -c*s*b2(s)/3 + c*a1(s)/6 - c*a2(s)/3 - c*b1(s)/3 + c*b2(s)/3 + Derivative(a2(s), s)/3
  a3(s) [from general hand recursion, k=2]: -c*(2*(s - 1)*b2(s) - a1(s) + 2*b1(s))/6 - c*a2(s)/3 + Derivative(a2(s), s)/3
  difference (should be 0): 0
  b2'(s) [from g^2 coeff of Psi-eq]:  c*(2*s*b2(s) - a1(s) + 2*b1(s))/2
  b2'(s) [from general hand recursion, k=2]: c*(2*s*b2(s) - a1(s) + 2*b1(s))/2
  difference (should be 0): 0

